reateContainerConfigError) → Pod 处于 Pending 阶段，应用不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` 的 Spec 定义错误引用了 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在的配置项 `unavailable-key`。\n\n**证据支持：**\n*   直接错误信息来源于 K8s 状态事实：`couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` (事实编号：`fact-9533b96af4f0`)。\n*   该错误导致 Kubelet 拒绝启动容器，直接表现为 `CreateContainerConfigError` (事实编号：`fact-a85cd51a285d`)，且 Prometheus 监控指标一致确认了该等待状态 (事实编号：`fact-17b8385e26c1`)。\n\n**结论：**\n配置错误导致容器启动失败，现有证据充分支持该结论，无需补充决定性事实。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 66.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 66.3s (Evidence 58.7s, RCA 7.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 98.088, "metrics": {"run_id": "36456e45d85347b6", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 98.10866212844849, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "50%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 98108.66212844849, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 92906.90350532532, "tool_calls": 18, "executed_tool_calls": 18, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 10975.730419158936, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4725.349187850952}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18466.760635375977, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 66322.00288772583, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 13267.559289932251, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

